<title>MALAYSIA: TABLE-Southern 6-mth net up 84.14 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Southern 6-mth net up 84.14 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		  75.84   vs	  41.19</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	 27.0    vs	  14.7</p>
<p>    Turnover		   534.29   vs	 508.23</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	    76.76   vs	  42.19</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.94   vs  less   0.36</p>
<p>    Dividend   (percent)     5.0    vs	   --</p>
<p>NOTE - Malaysia's Southern Steel Bhd isengaged in the manufacture and trading of steel bars and wire rods.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
